@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h1>About KindHelp</h1>
<p>
    KindHelp is a small, low-cost platform that publishes verified charity cases and lets
    contributors quietly support them. We do not charge platform fees, do not run ads, and do
    not display any personally identifiable donor data to anyone other than the donor themselves.
</p>

<h2>How it works</h2>
<ol>
    <li>Admins publish a case with the full background, photos, and goal.</li>
    <li>Contributors send their donation through the channels listed on the case page (bank transfer, mobile wallet, cash, etc.).</li>
    <li>Admins record the contribution against the donor's account.</li>
    <li>The donor sees the contribution and any future case updates on their private dashboard. No one else does.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Privacy promise</h2>
<p>
    Public pages show only aggregate totals: amount raised and number of supporters. Names,
    emails, and individual amounts are never shown to other donors. This is enforced in code,
    not just in policy.
</p>
